<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Great Belt issues new four pct 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Great Belt issues new four pct 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Unidanmark on Monday.</p>
<p> BORROWER GREAT BELT (A/S STOREBAELTSFORBINDELSEN)</p>
<p> AMT 300 MLN DKK COUPON 4.00</p>
<p> MATURITY 20. DEC. 2006 TYPE STRAIGHT</p>
<p> ISS PRICE UNDISC DATE 24.JAN. 1997</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
